<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46738" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠερό-εις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span>, 
			Ion.
		 and 
			Ep.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀερόεις</span> (q.v., cf. cj.
		in <i><span class="en">
			Telest.
			1.12
		</span></i>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cloudy, murky</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τάρταρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.13
				</span></i>
			, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				119
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζόφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					15.191
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠερόεντα κέλευθα</span>
			<i>the murky</i> road (i.e. death), <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				20.64
			</span></i>; later 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠ. ἴασπις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.P.
					724
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόλυβδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Man.
					6.391
				</span></i>
			; <i>livid</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χροιή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					257
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> epith. of
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄναγρος</span>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταχύς</span>, acc. to Sch., <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				3.183
			</span></i>.</div>
